<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 26a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/32/eng@> .
